{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26855","headline":"陕下厉玄侍御宅五题 垂钓亭 · 姚合","name":"陕下厉玄侍御宅五题 垂钓亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"由钓起茅亭，柴扉复竹楹。\n波清见丝影，坐久识鱼情。\n白鸟依窗宿，青蒲傍砌生。\n欲同渔父舍，须自减逢迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26855.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26855","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}